OL,3,GNEWSABritish Empire Award for parish
OL,4,Avolunteer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Guernsey who has dedicated
OL,7,F"thousands of personal hours" to parish
OL,8,Fupkeep while supporting vulnerable
OL,9,Fparishioners has been presented with a
OL,10,FBritish Empire Award.
OL,12,FBen Gregg's award follows "25 years of
OL,13,Fexemplary, selfless and wholly
OL,14,Fvoluntary service" to St Martin and the
OL,15,Fwider bailiwick community, said the
OL,16,FOffice of the Lieutenant-Governor.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
