OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABritish Empire Award for parish
OL,4,Avolunteer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis Excellency Lt Gen Sir Richard
OL,7,FCripwell said: "Mr Gregg's sustained
OL,8,Fcommitment, practical leadership, and
OL,9,Ftireless work ethic have left an
OL,10,Fenduring legacy for not only the parish
OL,11,Fand its parishioners but Guernsey as a
OL,12,Fwhole.
OL,14,F"It is an honour to present him with a
OL,15,FBritish Empire Award on behalf of the
OL,16,Fking."
